WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.680
Dan: Okay, I'm seeing connection resets on two of the three nodes.

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.217
Priya: Two out of three. That's our blast radius.

3
00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:13.441
Dan: Yeah. And the health check is failing on both.

4
00:00:13.441 --> 00:00:17.953
Sam: Health check failing. Is the cert expired?

5
00:00:17.953 --> 00:00:23.546
Dan: Let me check... You're right. It expired at midnight.

6
00:00:23.546 --> 00:00:28.466
Priya: So the cert expired, and the rotation itself didn't pick it up.

7
00:00:28.466 --> 00:00:30.747
Alex: That explains the 502s.

8
00:00:30.747 --> 00:00:34.803
Dan: But the other nodes are having the new cert, so it's not everywhere.

9
00:00:34.803 --> 00:00:39.987
Priya: Right. So it's flapping between good and bad nodes.

10
00:00:39.987 --> 00:00:44.596
Sam: That matches the error rate. It's not flat.

11
00:00:44.596 --> 00:00:48.820
Priya: Okay. I think we've got the shape of it.

